      "value": "I can reproduce this on stable with my Quest 3. VRChat will sometimes stop playing audio to bluetooth headphones after a lag spike. The headphones are still connected to the device and Quest UI sounds still play. I end up having to disconnect and reconnect my headphones pretty often.\n\nRepro steps:\n\n1. Connect a Bluetooth audio device to an android (Quest or mobile) device\n\n2. Launch VRChat and go to a large, laggy lobby\n\n3. Wait for lag spikes\n\n4. VRChat stops playing audio to Bluetooth",
